{
  "id": 368542271,
  "iid": 19278,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "DIAMETER: Additional Result-Code fields",
  "description": "Add two additional fields for AVP=Result-Code on Command level\nand AVP=Multiple-Services-Credit-Control level.\n\nSometimes it needs to filter messages only by Result-Code on MSCC level.\n\nExample: [cca_mscc_result_code.pcap](/uploads/d226f28d6efc06fcde62802cb47a68a3/cca_mscc_result_code.pcap)\n\nBefore:\n```\nAVP: Result-Code(268) l=12 f=-M- val=DIAMETER_SUCCESS (2001)\n    AVP Code: 268 Result-Code\n    AVP Flags: 0x40, Mandatory: Set\n    AVP Length: 12\n    Result-Code: DIAMETER_SUCCESS (2001)\n\nMultiple-Services-Credit-Control\n    AVP: Rating-Group(432) l=12 f=-M- val=8765432\n    AVP: Result-Code(268) l=12 f=-M- val=DIAMETER_CREDIT_LIMIT_REACHED (4012)\n        AVP Code: 268 Result-Code\n        AVP Flags: 0x40, Mandatory: Set\n        AVP Length: 12\n        Result-Code: DIAMETER_CREDIT_LIMIT_REACHED (4012)\n```\n\nAfter:\n```\nAVP: Result-Code(268) l=12 f=-M- val=DIAMETER_SUCCESS (2001)\n    AVP Code: 268 Result-Code\n    AVP Flags: 0x40, Mandatory: Set\n    AVP Length: 12\n    Result-Code: DIAMETER_SUCCESS (2001)\n    [Result-Code-Command-Level: 2001]\n\nMultiple-Services-Credit-Control\n    AVP: Rating-Group(432) l=12 f=-M- val=8765432\n    AVP: Result-Code(268) l=12 f=-M- val=DIAMETER_CREDIT_LIMIT_REACHED (4012)\n        AVP Code: 268 Result-Code\n        AVP Flags: 0x40, Mandatory: Set\n        AVP Length: 12\n        Result-Code: DIAMETER_CREDIT_LIMIT_REACHED (4012)\n        [Result-Code-MSCC-Level: 4012]\n```",
  "state": "merged",
